PRAYER

In the light of the facts and circumstances stated above, the Petitioner most respectfully prays that this Hon'ble Court may graciously be pleased to:

a) Issue an appropriate writ, order or direction, more particularly a writ in the nature of {writ_type_primary}, quashing and setting aside {impugned_order_brief};

b) Issue a writ in the nature of mandamus directing the Respondents to {positive_relief};

c) Pending hearing and final disposal of the present petition, stay the operation and effect of {impugned_order_brief};

d) Award costs of this petition; and

e) Pass any other order(s) as this Hon'ble Court may deem fit and proper in the interest of justice.

And for this act of kindness, the Petitioner shall ever pray.
